{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/269c27adf1fe1742df283131bb7b6169.poster.avif?t=1774207146\" width=1170 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/269c27adf1fe1742df283131bb7b6169.webm?t=1774207146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/269c27adf1fe1742df283131bb7b6169.mp4?t=1774207146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own summoner's shop in a medieval town with a Lovecraftian atmosphere. Summon a hat, a chicken, or an Ancient God. Save the world\u2014or don\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone urgently needs something summoned. New pants? You got it! A pocket dragon? No problem! A swarm of angry bees? Questionable\u2026 but sure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients, draw magic circles (preferably not wonky), and fulfill requests until you run out of money, luck, or patience. (Seriously, what is wrong with these people?!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/2350047e77bf19d5699d9fbaefaa0faa.poster.avif?t=1774207146\" width=1170 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/2350047e77bf19d5699d9fbaefaa0faa.webm?t=1774207146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/2350047e77bf19d5699d9fbaefaa0faa.mp4?t=1774207146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between summoning cats and seductive demons, maybe try to figure out who you really are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why don\u2019t you remember your life before the shop? How did you even end up in this town? And what\u2019s the deal with that shady Merchant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and about that amnesia\u2014don\u2019t forget to pay your taxes. Or do. Prison\u2019s a perfectly fine place for a nap, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/78b97461ab187e813ca2d85b5e0fc8bb.poster.avif?t=1774207146\" width=1170 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/78b97461ab187e813ca2d85b5e0fc8bb.webm?t=1774207146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/78b97461ab187e813ca2d85b5e0fc8bb.mp4?t=1774207146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might go bankrupt, become a local legend, or accidentally trigger the apocalypse. It\u2019s all up to you. Well\u2026 mostly up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovecraftian atmosphere. The cult is somewhere nearby</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon objects, creatures, and &quot;surprises&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird and wonderful clients with even weirder requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your shop, stock up on ingredients, learn new rituals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic, absurdity, and humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings\u2014from legendary success to &quot;welp, that escalated quickly&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door to a world where every order is a chance to make a coin\u2026 or destroy half the town!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576580?t=1774207146","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576580?t=1774207146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/b990ce09c3dad42a74c17998e2ee391a4a7a3989/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774207146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/b990ce09c3dad42a74c17998e2ee391a4a7a3989/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774207146","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3820930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.poster.avif?t=1774207146\" width=356 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.webm?t=1774207146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.mp4?t=1774207146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/269c27adf1fe1742df283131bb7b6169.poster.avif?t=1774207146\" width=1170 height=482 ><source src=\"https: