ace for a nap, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/78b97461ab187e813ca2d85b5e0fc8bb.poster.avif?t=1774207146\" width=1170 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/78b97461ab187e813ca2d85b5e0fc8bb.webm?t=1774207146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/78b97461ab187e813ca2d85b5e0fc8bb.mp4?t=1774207146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might go bankrupt, become a local legend, or accidentally trigger the apocalypse. It\u2019s all up to you. Well\u2026 mostly up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovecraftian atmosphere. The cult is somewhere nearby</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon objects, creatures, and &quot;surprises&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird and wonderful clients with even weirder requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your shop, stock up on ingredients, learn new rituals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic, absurdity, and humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings\u2014from legendary success to &quot;welp, that escalated quickly&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door to a world where every order is a chance to make a coin\u2026 or destroy half the town!</p>","developers":["Noxtell Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/1c74177173fa5aecaa890645c53985a7753aaf96/header.jpg?t=1774207146","is_free":false,"linux_require